OL,3,GNEWSAEx-bingo hall to become immersive
OL,4,Afilm experience
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lease has been secured to transform a
OL,7,Fvacant bingo hall into an "immersive
OL,8,Fexperience" where visitors can become a
OL,9,Ffilm crew.
OL,11,FThe contract is for a
OL,12,F23,000-square-foot space in The Point
OL,13,Fon Borehamwood High Street in
OL,14,FHertfordshire, close to the famous
OL,15,FElstree Studios.
OL,17,FThe Elstree Immersive Experience
OL,18,Fproject is funded by Hertsmere Council
OL,19,Fwith #2m from the Community
OL,20,FInfrastructure Levy and #1.3m in
OL,21,Fexternal investment.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
